{"seq":3,"slug":"base-unit-inventory-multiuom","title":"基准单位库存与多单位库存（联034）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/unit-measure-packsize-conversion/uom-pricing-inventory/base-unit-inventory-multiuom","wordCount":1704,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"基准单位库存与多单位库存-联034\">基准单位库存与多单位库存（联034）</h1><p>仓库里同一种货可能以三种形态存在：库位上是 3 个整箱、拣货区躺着 7 个散件、待发区有 1 个拆了一半的箱。财务问&quot;这个 SKU 有多少货&quot;，答案必须是一个数，不能是&quot;3 箱 7 件&quot;。这个数就是<strong>基准单位库存</strong>——它是账面的唯一表示，其余所有单位表达都是它的投影。</p>\n<p>多单位库存这个词常被误解为&quot;同时维护几套账&quot;。恰恰相反，它的正确含义是：<strong>只有一套账，但允许用多种单位读写</strong>。这一篇讲的就是如何保证这套账的唯一性与可换算性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>库存账的唯一真理是<strong>基准单位数量</strong>；其余所有单位表达都是它在不同粒度上的投影。投影的两个性质定义了整个模型：<strong>可逆</strong>（投影后的数量能无损换算回基准单位）与<strong>不独立</strong>（投影不能单独变动，只能随基准量变动）。违反任一条，就退化成了多套账。</p>\n<p>与之正交的是<strong>粒度</strong>：多少货以箱的形态存在、多少是散件。粒度不改变总量，却决定了哪些货可拣。因此账面模型必须同时承载&quot;多少&quot;与&quot;以什么粒度&quot;两个维度，并且二者之间必须有一条守恒约束——这是这一篇里唯一一条不能放宽的硬要求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么不能有多套账\">为什么不能有多套账</h2><h3 id=\"三套账的必然结局\">三套账的必然结局</h3><p>若库存表支持&quot;按箱记&quot;和&quot;按件记&quot;两种并存，第一周它们看起来一致，第一笔业务就会分叉：收货时按箱记 3 箱，拣货时按件扣 7 件——箱账没动、件账少了 7，两个数字都在，但没有任何规则能说清合起来是多少。更糟的是两套账的更新不在同一事务里时，任何一个环节失败都会留下永久的不一致。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基准单位是账面的唯一表示\">基准单位是账面的唯一表示</h3><p>正确做法是把库存数量一律以基准单位存储，单位只是<strong>读写的视图</strong>。写入时把任何单位的数量换算成基准单位；读出时按需要的单位换算回去。换算规则来自 <a href=\"../uom-masterdata/base-sales-uom-definition\">基本单位/销售单位与单位族定义</a> 的单位族与因子。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[收货单: 3 箱] --&gt; B[换算成基准单位]&#10;  C[拣货单: 7 件] --&gt; B&#10;  D[盘盈亏: 0.2 kg] --&gt; B&#10;  B --&gt; E[(库存账: 仅基准单位)]&#10;  E --&gt; F[按箱视图]&#10;  E --&gt; G[按件视图]&#10;  E --&gt; H[按千克视图]&#10;  F --&gt; I[对外/报表]&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n  A[收货单: 3 箱] --&gt; B[换算成基准单位]\n  C[拣货单: 7 件] --&gt; B\n  D[盘盈亏: 0.2 kg] --&gt; B\n  B --&gt; E[(库存账: 仅基准单位)]\n  E --&gt; F[按箱视图]\n  E --&gt; G[按件视图]\n  E --&gt; H[按千克视图]\n  F --&gt; I[对外/报表]\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"账面模型\">账面模型</h2><h3 id=\"数量与粒度的分离\">数量与粒度的分离</h3><p>基准单位解决&quot;多少&quot;，包装层级解决&quot;以什么粒度存在&quot;。两者必须同时记，否则无法判断&quot;这 7 件是可拣的散件还是必须整箱发的货&quot;。</p>\n<p>粒度这一侧还与<strong>物流单元</strong>的标识相衔接：托盘作为三级包装（tertiary packaging）通常不分配 GTIN，而使用 18 位的 SSCC（Serial Shipping Container Code，序列货运集装箱代码）——由扩展位、GS1 公司前缀、序列引用与校验位组成，常以 GS1-128 条码或 RFID 承载，收货方拆托后该码即完成使命，托内对象改用 GRAI/GIAI 单独标识（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Serial_Shipping_Container_Code\">SSCC</a>）。这把&quot;库存的粒度&quot;与&quot;标识的层级&quot;明确分开：账本记数量与粒度，标识体系记实体身份。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE inventory_balance (&#10;  sku_id        text NOT NULL,&#10;  location_id   text NOT NULL,&#10;  lot_no        text NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;&#39;,&#10;  serial_no     text NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;&#39;,&#10;  stock_state   text NOT NULL,            -- AVAILABLE / HOLD / IN_TRANSIT&#10;  qty_base      numeric(24,9) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  base_uom      text NOT NULL REFERENCES uom(uom_code),&#10;  breakdown     jsonb NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;{}&#39;::jsonb,&#10;  updated_at    timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  version       bigint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (sku_id, location_id, lot_no, serial_no, stock_state),&#10;  CONSTRAINT chk_state CHECK (&#10;    stock_state IN (&#39;AVAILABLE&#39;,&#39;HOLD&#39;,&#39;IN_TRANSIT&#39;))&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE inventory_ledger (&#10;  entry_id      bigint GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  sku_id        text NOT NULL,&#10;  location_id   text NOT NULL,&#10;  lot_no        text NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;&#39;,&#10;  delta_base    numeric(24,9) NOT NULL,&#10;  reason        text NOT NULL,&#10;  ref_type      text NOT NULL,&#10;  ref_id        text NOT NULL,&#10;  idempotency_key text NOT NULL,&#10;  occurred_at   timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  UNIQUE (idempotency_key)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inventory_balance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  location_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lot_no        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  serial_no     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stock_state   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- AVAILABLE / HOLD / IN_TRANSIT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  qty_base      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  base_uom      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uom(uom_code),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  breakdown     jsonb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::jsonb,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  updated_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (sku_id, location_id, lot_no, serial_no, stock_state),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chk_state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    stock_state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'AVAILABLE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'HOLD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'IN_TRANSIT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inventory_ledger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entry_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GENERATED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ALWAYS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IDENTITY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  location_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lot_no        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  delta_base    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reason        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ref_type      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ref_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  idempotency_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  occurred_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (idempotency_key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>inventory_ledger</code> 是不可变的事实表，<code>inventory_balance</code> 是它的物化投影。两者都保留的理由是：余额查询要快，而任何一次余额变动必须能追溯到原始事件——尤其在需要向海关或审计解释&quot;这 3 箱去哪了&quot;的时候。</p>\n<p><code>breakdown</code> 这个 jsonb 字段存的是<strong>粒度构成</strong>，例如 <code>{&quot;CASE&quot;: 3, &quot;EACH&quot;: 7}</code>。它不是数量的第二份真相，而是余额在包装层级上的分解，必须满足与 <code>qty_base</code> 的一致性约束。</p>\n<h3 id=\"幂等键的必要性\">幂等键的必要性</h3><p><code>idempotency_key</code> 的唯一约束拦的是重复投递：一次收货事件被消息队列重投两次，若无幂等键，账面会多出一倍的货。键的构造通常是 <code>ref_type + ref_id + reason + 序号</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"粒度分解的守恒\">粒度分解的守恒</h2><h3 id=\"一条硬约束\">一条硬约束</h3><p><code>breakdown</code> 里的各级数量换算回基准单位后，必须精确等于 <code>qty_base</code>（在基准单位的分辨率内）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>levels</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>units_per_base</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{l \\in \\text{levels}} n_l \\cdot \\text{units\\_per\\_base}(l) = q_{\\text{base}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3795em;vertical-align:-1.3295em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">levels</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3295em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">units_per_base</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把它实现成写路径上的断言，而不是定期的巡检，能在错误写入的第一时间拦住它。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION check_breakdown_consistency(&#10;  p_sku text, p_location text, p_lot text, p_state text&#10;) RETURNS boolean AS $$&#10;DECLARE&#10;  v_qty numeric(24,9);&#10;  v_breakdown jsonb;&#10;  v_sum numeric(24,9) := 0;&#10;  v_level text;&#10;  v_cnt numeric(24,9);&#10;  v_units_per_base numeric(38,18);&#10;BEGIN&#10;  SELECT qty_base, breakdown INTO v_qty, v_breakdown&#10;  FROM inventory_balance&#10;  WHERE sku_id=p_sku AND location_id=p_location&#10;    AND lot_no=p_lot AND stock_state=p_state;&#10;&#10;  FOR v_level, v_cnt IN&#10;    SELECT key, value::numeric FROM jsonb_each_text(v_breakdown)&#10;  LOOP&#10;    SELECT ti.units_per_parent * u.factor_to_base&#10;      INTO v_units_per_base&#10;    FROM trade_item ti&#10;    JOIN uom u ON u.uom_code = ti.net_content_uom&#10;    WHERE ti.sku_id = p_sku AND ti.pack_level = v_level&#10;    LIMIT 1;&#10;    IF v_units_per_base IS NULL THEN&#10;      RAISE EXCEPTION &#39;unknown pack level % for sku %&#39;, v_level, p_sku;&#10;    END IF;&#10;    v_sum := v_sum + v_cnt * v_units_per_base;&#10;  END LOOP;&#10;&#10;  RETURN ABS(v_sum - v_qty) &lt; 1e-9;&#10;END;&#10;$$ LANGUAGE plpgsql;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE OR REPLACE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FUNCTION</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> check_breakdown_consistency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  p_sku </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, p_location </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, p_lot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, p_state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">RETURNS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $$</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECLARE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  v_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  v_breakdown jsonb;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  v_sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  v_level </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  v_cnt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  v_units_per_base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">38</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qty_base, breakdown </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_qty, v_breakdown</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory_balance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p_sku </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> location_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p_location</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lot_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p_lot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stock_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p_state;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FOR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_level, v_cnt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jsonb_each_text(v_breakdown)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LOOP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ti</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">units_per_parent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">factor_to_base</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_units_per_base</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trade_item ti</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uom u </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">uom_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ti</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">net_content_uom</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ti</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_sku </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ti</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pack_level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_level</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    IF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_units_per_base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      RAISE EXCEPTION </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'unknown pack level % for sku %'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, v_level, p_sku;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    v_sum :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_cnt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_units_per_base;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LOOP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  RETURN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ABS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v_sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_qty) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 1e</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$$ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LANGUAGE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plpgsql;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个函数把&quot;粒度分解必须守恒&quot;从口头纪律变成了可执行的检查。若某次写入让二者不等，说明层级换算与单位因子被人为改动过。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多单位读写的一致策略\">多单位读写的一致策略</h2><h3 id=\"读-投影而非复制\">读：投影而非复制</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;stock_view_policy&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;storage&quot;: &quot;BASE_ONLY&quot;,&#10;    &quot;projection&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;on_read&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;rounding&quot;: &quot;HALF_EVEN&quot;,&#10;      &quot;allow_fractional_units&quot;: false,&#10;      &quot;on_non_integral&quot;: &quot;FLOOR_AND_SHOW_REMAINDER&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;write_paths&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;receiving&quot;: &quot;convert_to_base_on_entry&quot;,&#10;      &quot;picking&quot;: &quot;convert_to_base_on_entry&quot;,&#10;      &quot;adjustment&quot;: &quot;convert_to_base_on_entry&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;prohibited&quot;: [&quot;second_balance_table_per_uom&quot;, &quot;uom_specific_column&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"stock_view_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"storage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BASE_ONLY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"projection\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"on_read\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rounding\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"HALF_EVEN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"allow_fractional_units\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"on_non_integral\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FLOOR_AND_SHOW_REMAINDER\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"write_paths\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"receiving\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"convert_to_base_on_entry\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"picking\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"convert_to_base_on_entry\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"adjustment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"convert_to_base_on_entry\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"prohibited\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"second_balance_table_per_uom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"uom_specific_column\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>on_non_integral</code> 选 <code>FLOOR_AND_SHOW_REMAINDER</code> 是刻意的：账面上有 3.4 箱时，页面显示&quot;3 箱 + 余量&quot;，而不是显示&quot;3.4 箱&quot;——后者会诱导操作员认为存在 0.4 箱的实体。同样，<code>allow_fractional_units</code> 为 false 保证不会出现&quot;半箱&quot;这种无法履约的库存。</p>\n<h3 id=\"写-入口即归一\">写：入口即归一</h3><p>所有写入路径在进入账面之前完成换算，账面函数只接受基准单位。这条纪律的效果是：<strong>换算法则在系统里只有一个执行点</strong>，修改因子或精度时不需要搜索全部写入路径。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 收货：3 箱另 7 件，入口归一为基准单位&#10;INSERT INTO inventory_ledger&#10;  (sku_id, location_id, lot_no, delta_base, reason, ref_type, ref_id, idempotency_key)&#10;SELECT&#10;  &#39;SKU-4471&#39;, &#39;WH-SH-01&#39;, &#39;LOT-20260920&#39;,&#10;  (3 * ti_case.units_per_parent * u.factor_to_base)&#10;  + (7 * ti_each.units_per_parent * u.factor_to_base),&#10;  &#39;RECEIVING&#39;, &#39;ASN&#39;, &#39;ASN-2026-0918-77&#39;,&#10;  &#39;ASN-2026-0918-77:SKU-4471:1&#39;&#10;FROM trade_item ti_case&#10;JOIN trade_item ti_each ON ti_each.gtin = ti_case.parent_gtin&#10;JOIN uom u ON u.uom_code = ti_each.net_content_uom&#10;WHERE ti_case.sku_id = &#39;SKU-4471&#39; AND ti_case.pack_level = &#39;CASE&#39;&#10;  AND ti_each.pack_level = &#39;EACH&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 收货：3 箱另 7 件，入口归一为基准单位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory_ledger</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (sku_id, location_id, lot_no, delta_base, reason, ref_type, ref_id, idempotency_key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'SKU-4471'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'WH-SH-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'LOT-20260920'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ti_case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">units_per_parent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">factor_to_base</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ti_each</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">units_per_parent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">factor_to_base</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'RECEIVING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ASN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ASN-2026-0918-77'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'ASN-2026-0918-77:SKU-4471:1'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trade_item ti_case</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trade_item ti_each </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ti_each</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gtin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ti_case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">parent_gtin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uom u </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">uom_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ti_each</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">net_content_uom</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ti_case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'SKU-4471'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ti_case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pack_level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CASE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ti_each</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pack_level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'EACH'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"与报关-盘点的衔接\">与报关、盘点的衔接</h2><h3 id=\"报关量不是库存量\">报关量不是库存量</h3><p>报关申报的数量必须落在法定计量单位上，而这个单位往往既不是基准单位也不是销售单位。系统需要维护一条<strong>从基准单位到法定单位</strong>的映射，其正确性由 <a href=\"../uom-customs-rounding/customs-statutory-uom-declare\">报关与法定检验计量单位映射</a> 保证。库存账不因为报关而改变单位——报关读的是账面值的一个投影。</p>\n<h3 id=\"盘点的两种粒度\">盘点的两种粒度</h3><p>盘点可以按最低可拣粒度（更精确）或按包装层级（更快）执行，但结果必须回到基准单位。盘盈亏的归因顺序与残差处理见 <a href=\"../uom-customs-rounding/uom-rounding-residual-control\">单位换算四舍五入与残差控制</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>账面来源</th>\n<th>允许的粒度</th>\n<th>归因优先级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全盘</td>\n<td>基准单位</td>\n<td>最低可拣粒度</td>\n<td>记录错误 → 拆箱损耗 → 盗窃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抽盘</td>\n<td>基准单位</td>\n<td>包装层级</td>\n<td>层级换算错误 → 计数错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环盘点</td>\n<td>基准单位</td>\n<td>库位</td>\n<td>位移未记 → 拆零未记</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>库存账面必须只有唯一一个基准单位表示；多单位库存是它的视图，不是并列账本。</li>\n<li>余额（物化投影）与流水（不可变事实）都要保留；写入以幂等键防重投。</li>\n<li>粒度分解必须与基准数量守恒，这条约束应作为写入断言而非事后巡检。</li>\n<li>所有写入路径在入口换算成基准单位，使换算法则只有一个执行点；读出时按需投影，且不显示分数个实体。</li>\n<li>报关量是账面值在法定单位上的投影，不改变库存储存单位。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一篇 <a href=\"../uom-customs-rounding/customs-statutory-uom-declare\">报关与法定检验计量单位映射</a> 进入监管口径。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"基准单位库存与多单位库存（联034）","id":"基准单位库存与多单位库存-联034"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么不能有多套账","id":"为什么不能有多套账"},{"level":3,"text":"三套账的必然结局","id":"三套账的必然结局"},{"level":3,"text":"基准单位是账面的唯一表示","id":"基准单位是账面的唯一表示"},{"level":2,"text":"账面模型","id":"账面模型"},{"level":3,"text":"数量与粒度的分离","id":"数量与粒度的分离"},{"level":3,"text":"幂等键的必要性","id":"幂等键的必要性"},{"level":2,"text":"粒度分解的守恒","id":"粒度分解的守恒"},{"level":3,"text":"一条硬约束","id":"一条硬约束"},{"level":2,"text":"多单位读写的一致策略","id":"多单位读写的一致策略"},{"level":3,"text":"读：投影而非复制","id":"读-投影而非复制"},{"level":3,"text":"写：入口即归一","id":"写-入口即归一"},{"level":2,"text":"与报关、盘点的衔接","id":"与报关-盘点的衔接"},{"level":3,"text":"报关量不是库存量","id":"报关量不是库存量"},{"level":3,"text":"盘点的两种粒度","id":"盘点的两种粒度"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"按重量计价/可变重量(catch-weight)商品","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/unit-measure-packsize-conversion/uom-pricing-inventory/catch-weight-variable-weight"},"next":{"title":"报关/法定检验计量单位映射（联040/075）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/unit-measure-packsize-conversion/uom-customs-rounding/customs-statutory-uom-declare"}}